{"title":"Docker 命令总结","date":"2024-09-10T16:00:00.000Z","toc":false,"summary":"","source":"_posts/软件测试/工具流/Docker/Docker 常用命令.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Docker 命令总结\ntags: [Docker, 工具相关]\nsummary: \"\"\ntoc: false\ncopyright: \"\"\ndate: 2024-09-11\n---\n\n## Docker 基本命令\n\n### 镜像相关命令\n\n- 本地镜像查看\n\n```shell\n\ndocker images\n```\n\n- 远端镜像查看\n\n\n```shell\n# docker search nginx\n$ docker search [keyword]\n```\n\n- 远端镜像下载\n\n```shell\n\ndocker pull nginx\n```\n\n- 删除 images（镜像），通过 image 的 id 来指定删除\n\n```shell\n\ndocker rmi [image id]\n```\n\n\n### 容器相关命令\n\n- 查看所有运行或者不运行的容器\n\n```shell\n\ndocker ps\n```\n\n- 列出所有容器\n\n```shell\n\ndocker ps -a\n```\n\n- 容器启动\n\n```shell\n\ndocker run\n```\n\n- 进入/退出容器\n\n\n```shell\ndocker exec -it [name / id] bash\n# 退出\nexit\n```\n\n- 停止运行容器\n\n```shell\ndocker stop [容器id 或名称]\n```\n\n- 重启容器\n\n```shell\n\ndocker restart [容器id 或名称]\n```\n\n- 容器销毁\n\n```shell\n# 先停止\n$ docker stop [容器id 或名称]\n# 再销毁\n$ docker rm [容器id 或名称]\n```\n\n- 查看容器日志\n\n```shell\n\ndocker logs [容器id 或名称]\n```\n\n\n\n## Docker 开机配置\n\n- docker 中启动所有的容器命令\n\n```shell\n\ndocker start $(docker ps -a | awk '{ print $1}' | tail -n +2)\n```\n\n- docker 中关闭所有的容器命令\n\n```shell\n\ndocker stop $(docker ps -a | awk '{ print $1}' | tail -n +2)\n```\n\n- docker 中删除所有的容器命令\n\n```shell\n\ndocker rm $(docker ps -a | awk '{ print $1}' | tail -n +2)\n```\n\n- docker 中删除所有的镜像\n\n```shell\n\ndocker rmi $(docker images | awk '{print $3}' |tail -n +2)\n```\n\n- docker 开机启动\n\n```shell\n\nsystemctl enable docker\n```\n\n- docker 服务启动\n\n```shell\n$ systemctl start docker       \n# 重启命令  \n$ systemctl restart docker\n```\n\n","slug":"软件测试/工具流/Docker/Docker 常用命令","published":true,"updated":"2024-09-10T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5xp0024prqba28b8r5l","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"Docker-基本命令\"><a href=\"#Docker-基本命令\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Docker 基本命令\"></a>Docker 基本命令</h2><h3 id=\"镜像相关命令\"><a href=\"#镜像相关命令\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"镜像相关命令\"></a>镜像